---
name: Map an OpenSSH message to OCSF in stages
description: |
  Parses an OpenSSH message, adds fields from its Syslog envelope, maps the
  result to OCSF, and stores the message body in `raw_data`. Use this pipeline
  when you need to inspect or route the parsed event before mapping it.
---

from {
  timestamp: 2026-01-01T00:00:00Z,
  hostname: "bastion-01",
  message: "Failed password for invalid user admin from 198.51.100.42 port 49152 ssh2",
}
openssh::parse message, event
event.time = move timestamp
event.hostname = move hostname
openssh::ocsf::map event, ocsf
this = {
  ...ocsf,
  raw_data: message,
  raw_data_size: message.length_bytes(),
}
